# Bat Hunt (San d'Oria 1-2): the sections that do not apply. Main, a level 10 Warrior of Bastok with an Orcish Scale
# Mail, in Southern San d'Oria: Endracion: not a San d'Orian: no section 1 (his script plays 1011); the mail traded:
# his script's 1010. bob, a level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with Save the Children current (a GM): Endracion: 1-2's
# sections fail (another mission current; Save the Children's 1025 plays); the mail traded: his script's 1008. carol, a
# San d'Orian with Bat Hunt current at status 3 (a GM): 1-2's sections need status below 2 or exactly 2: none answers
# (his script plays 1001); the mail traded: his script's 1008.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrade
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
char bob zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char carol zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
carol: mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
carol: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
bob: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
carol: mission Sandoria BatHunt current
item OrcishMailScales
bob: item OrcishMailScales
carol: item OrcishMailScales
login
trigger Endracion                       # not a San d'Orian: no section: his script's 1011
finish option=101
walk -109.5,1,-34
trade Endracion OrcishMailScales x1     # no section 3: his script's 1010
bob: login
bob: trigger Endracion                  # another mission current: Save the Children's own section
bob: finish option=101
bob: walk -109.5,1,-34
bob: trade Endracion OrcishMailScales x1   # his script's 1008
carol: login
carol: missionstatus Sandoria 3         # a GM: neither below 2 nor 2
carol: trigger Endracion                # no 1-2 section answers: his script's 1001
carol: finish option=101
carol: walk -109.5,1,-34
carol: trade Endracion OrcishMailScales x1   # his script's 1008
